{% comment %}
  PDP policy summary

  This is the single PDP source for shipping and claim wording. It must mirror
  the Shopify Shipping and Refund Policy pages that are maintained through
  admin/sync_store_policies_3_3.py.

  Accepts:
  - context: "support" (default) or "delivery"
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign policy_context = context | default: 'support'
  assign shipping_policy_url = shop.shipping_policy.url
  assign refund_policy_url = shop.refund_policy.url
%}

{% if policy_context == 'delivery' %}
  <ul class="product-delivery-estimate__popover-list">
    <li>Made-to-order bedding usually takes about 3 business days to prepare before shipment.</li>
    <li>Estimated total delivery is 10-17 business days for the U.S. and Canada, and 17-24 business days for other supported destinations.</li>
    <li>For damaged, defective, incorrectly customized, or missing items, contact support@jeminise.com within 7 days of delivery with your order number and clear photos.</li>
  </ul>
{% else %}
  <div class="product-support-collapsible__details product-support-collapsible__details--shipping rte">
    <ul class="product-support-collapsible__summary-list" role="list">
      <li>Free standard shipping is available for eligible addresses in the 48 contiguous U.S. states and most of Canada. International shipping is $5.99 USD to supported destinations.</li>
      <li>Estimated total delivery is 10-17 business days for the U.S. and Canada, and 17-24 business days for other supported destinations.</li>
      <li>International duties, taxes, customs fees, and brokerage charges are not included in the $5.99 shipping fee and may be payable by the recipient.</li>
      <li>Personalized or custom items are prepared from the details you submit, so names, photos, dates, and messages should be reviewed before checkout.</li>
      <li>For damaged, defective, incorrectly customized, or missing items, contact support@jeminise.com within 7 days of delivery with your order number and clear photos so we can review the issue.</li>
      {% if shipping_policy_url != blank or refund_policy_url != blank %}
        <li>
          {% if shipping_policy_url != blank %}
            <a href="{{ shipping_policy_url }}">Read the Shipping Policy</a>
          {% endif %}
          {% if shipping_policy_url != blank and refund_policy_url != blank %}
            <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
          {% endif %}
          {% if refund_policy_url != blank %}
            <a href="{{ refund_policy_url }}">Read the Refund Policy</a>
          {% endif %}
        </li>
      {% endif %}
    </ul>
  </div>
{% endif %}
